&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;1968年２月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;ガスクロマトグラフ用のカラム充填剤及び消耗部品の製造・販売を目的として、資本金1,500千円でガスクロ工業株式会社を東京都新宿区柏木二丁目281番地に設立&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:0.0pt;min-height:0.0pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:9.8pt;min-height:9.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;1970年５月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;大阪府大阪市に大阪営業所(現大阪支店)を開設&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:9.8pt;min-height:9.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;1971年９月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;埼玉県所沢市に所沢工場を新築、本社工場より移転&lt;/p&gt;
